(7633150, 1237693, 173844, '<td valign="top">Lovely.  The light on and entering the structure is a pleasing cooperation of both soft and bright.  A terrific frame for the delightful scene within.  An elder is passing along knowledge and lore to a child.  The depth of field is perfect.  Satisfying, heart-warming and altogether fine image.</td>', 'Lovely.  The light on and entering the structure is a pleasing cooperation of both soft and bright.  A terrific frame for the delightful scene within.  An elder is passing along knowledge and lore to a child.  The depth of field is perfect.  Satisfying, heart-warming and altogether fine image.', '2019-06-20 12:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(7633151, 1237704, 173844, '<td valign="top">Excellent silhouetted study of these two men picked out by blue.  Both formal and informal, quiet, even modest, done with an accomplished eye.  The touches of additional color, green and burgundy, subtly add expansiveness to the image.  I really like the rim light on the upper edge of the foreground chair.  Fine title.</td>', 'Excellent silhouetted study of these two men picked out by blue.  Both formal and informal, quiet, even modest, done with an accomplished eye.  The touches of additional color, green and burgundy, subtly add expansiveness to the image.  I really like the rim light on the upper edge of the foreground chair.  Fine title.', '2019-06-20 12:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7633157, 1237705, 109227, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous light captured well.</td>', 'Gorgeous light captured well.', '2019-06-20 12:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(7633158, 1237720, 109227, '<td valign="top">Great scene.</td>', 'Great scene.', '2019-06-20 12:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7633159, 1237350, 109227, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light captured well.</td>', 'Beautiful light captured well.', '2019-06-20 12:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7633164, 1237699, 173844, '<td valign="top">The dog makes the picture, the light meets the challenge.  I like, here, how the sparkles and reflection are blown out -- it conveys intensity.  I also like how the light bleaches the green of the water, except where in the shadows its richness is retained.  You can feel the day begin.</td>', 'The dog makes the picture, the light meets the challenge.  I like, here, how the sparkles and reflection are blown out -- it conveys intensity.  I also like how the light bleaches the green of the water, except where in the shadows its richness is retained.  You can feel the day begin.', '2019-06-20 13:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(7633166, 1237588, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nice how the light tumbles down like a waterfall.</td>', 'Nice how the light tumbles down like a waterfall.', '2019-06-20 13:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(7633181, 1237678, 173844, '<td valign="top">Nicely apocalyptic.</td>', 'Nicely apocalyptic.', '2019-06-20 14:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(7633182, 1237726, 173844, '<td valign="top">Seeking asylum.  What''s an Administration to do?</td>', 'Seeking asylum.  What''s an Administration to do?', '2019-06-20 14:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7633183, 1237697, 173844, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.</td>', 'Very nice composition.', '2019-06-20 14:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7633184, 1237600, 173844, '<td valign="top">Straightforward and interesting.</td>', 'Straightforward and interesting.', '2019-06-20 14:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7633185, 1237728, 173844, '<td valign="top">The light imbues the plants with a magical delicacy.</td>', 'The light imbues the plants with a magical delicacy.', '2019-06-20 14:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(7633186, 1237691, 173844, '<td valign="top">Atmospheric port scene.  Fine contrasts.</td>', 'Atmospheric port scene.  Fine contrasts.', '2019-06-20 14:17:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(7633200, 1237707, 173844, '<td valign="top">A fascinating and handsome study of how light can pastelize (don''t bother to look that up) a scene.  The atmosphere is suffused with this transformative light.  Foreground, middleground and background are all well-established and vital to the balance and charm of the image.  I''ve struggled with the title but have come around to embracing it on a somewhat subconscious level.</td>', 'A fascinating and handsome study of how light can pastelize (don''t bother to look that up) a scene.  The atmosphere is suffused with this transformative light.  Foreground, middleground and background are all well-established and vital to the balance and charm of the image.  I''ve struggled with the title but have come around to embracing it on a somewhat subconscious level.', '2019-06-20 18:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(7633201, 1237721, 173844, '<td valign="top">I don''t know if this is a moment of triumph or reproach, but it''s powerful and crucially abetted by the stage lighting.  The glowing colors and minimal setting are refreshingly direct.  Fine composition.  Very nice.</td>', 'I don''t know if this is a moment of triumph or reproach, but it''s powerful and crucially abetted by the stage lighting.  The glowing colors and minimal setting are refreshingly direct.  Fine composition.  Very nice.', '2019-06-20 18:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7633202, 1237720, 173844, '<td valign="top">Peaceful, elegant sunset.  I like this image, have given it a seven, but I''d like to ask a question, offer a subjective suggestion and make a picayune quibble. The colored rays angling down from the middle left -- are those accurate or color noise?  I just don''t know.  Next, I''m thinking that cropping off the orange area on the bottom might improve the overall scene.  Lastly, I find the post and cross-piece below the right of the windmill a bit distracting.  Please accept these comments in the spirit in which they''re given.</td>', 'Peaceful, elegant sunset.  I like this image, have given it a seven, but I''d like to ask a question, offer a subjective suggestion and make a picayune quibble. The colored rays angling down from the middle left -- are those accurate or color noise?  I just don''t know.  Next, I''m thinking that cropping off the orange area on the bottom might improve the overall scene.  Lastly, I find the post and cross-piece below the right of the windmill a bit distracting.  Please accept these comments in the spirit in which they''re given.', '2019-06-20 18:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
