(7633235, 1237699, 97225, '<td valign="top">I bumped this up to 9, and into my top three, just before rollover and my attempt to comment was beaten. (The bump-up stuck though.) I had come back to it because it just stayed with me long after viewing. It is a beautiful. joyous photo and the light is wonderful.</td>', 'I bumped this up to 9, and into my top three, just before rollover and my attempt to comment was beaten. (The bump-up stuck though.) I had come back to it because it just stayed with me long after viewing. It is a beautiful. joyous photo and the light is wonderful.', '2019-06-21 02:34:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7633236, 1237720, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by marnet:</b></div><hr/><i>Where is this? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>These are saltworks of Marsala, Sicily. North west of Sicily is a real beauty for the eyes.</td>', 'Originally posted by marnet:Where is this?   These are saltworks of Marsala, Sicily. North west of Sicily is a real beauty for the eyes.', '2019-06-21 02:58:25.000000', NULL, 0),
