(7633246, 1237720, 109387, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your comments and votes. This is Sicily, a beautiful area of Italy I''ve never visited before. I know the image has some flaws but I had to edit it very fast and from Snapseed on my phone because I was away. Phone was not very reliable and couldn''t notice some of the defects. Still I''m happy with the result and I will edit it better :)</td>', 'Thanks everyone for your comments and votes. This is Sicily, a beautiful area of Italy I''ve never visited before. I know the image has some flaws but I had to edit it very fast and from Snapseed on my phone because I was away. Phone was not very reliable and couldn''t notice some of the defects. Still I''m happy with the result and I will edit it better :)', '2019-06-21 04:59:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(7633247, 1237718, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by marnet:</b></div><hr/><i> Congrats on the Red, Paul. I don''t know why but when I voted I really wanted this image to have more contrast :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I hear what you are saying but my editing skills fall short</td>', 'Originally posted by marnet: Congrats on the Red, Paul. I don''t know why but when I voted I really wanted this image to have more contrast :)   I hear what you are saying but my editing skills fall short', '2019-06-21 04:59:47.000000', NULL, 0),
